• The assistant no longer refuses to make a recipe because of a draft you cannot see.
• Asked for a new recipe with a draft open, it asks what to do with the draft first — and makes the recipe either way.
• iOS: a developer message that could appear over the app on launch is gone.
• Siri recognises the app's name more reliably.
• Recipes you saved can now be found from your phone's own search.

Thanks for cooking with Recipely!
